description: Canonical MotusTots tab bar and root safe area — do not revert to Expo defaults
globs: app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx,app/_layout.tsx
---

# Tab bar (source of truth)

- **`app/(tabs)/_layout.tsx`**
  - `tabBarActiveTintColor`: **`#006A60`** (not `#6200ee`).
  - Icons: **`@expo/vector-icons/MaterialCommunityIcons`** — not emoji inside `<Text>`.
  - **`useSafeAreaInsets()`** for `tabBarStyle.paddingBottom` and height.
  - **Order:** `index` (Home) → `education` → `reminders` → `activities` (title **Activities**) → `profile` (**More**, far right). Use **flat** files `education.tsx`, `reminders.tsx`, `activities.tsx`, `profile.tsx` under `(tabs)` so Expo route names match `Tabs.Screen` `name` (avoid `foo/index` mismatch warnings).

- **`app/_layout.tsx`**
  - Wrap app in **`SafeAreaProvider`** (outside or around `PaperProvider` per current tree).

Automated check: **`npm run check:tab-bar`**.
